      "content": "a break in the pattern... i feel like i've tried everything to break it. i take walks, i try to sleep, i try to distract myself, but nothing works. the emptiness just comes back every time. it's like the only way to actually stop the cycle would be to just... stop existing in it. like, if everything is already so dead and gone, what's the point of fighting to stay?",
